 data-start=&quot;6421&quot; data-section-id=&quot;hixkjl&quot;&gt;Q2. Difference between Precision and Recall?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;TyagGW_tableContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;&lt;table class=&quot;w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)&quot; data-end=&quot;6552&quot; data-start=&quot;6471&quot;&gt;&lt;thead data-end=&quot;6493&quot; data-start=&quot;6471&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-end=&quot;6493&quot; data-start=&quot;6471&quot;&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-end=&quot;6483&quot; data-start=&quot;6471&quot;&gt;Precision&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-end=&quot;6493&quot; data-start=&quot;6483&quot;&gt;Recall&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody data-end=&quot;6552&quot; data-start=&quot;6519&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-end=&quot;6552&quot; data-start=&quot;6519&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-end=&quot;6535&quot; data-start=&quot;6519&quot;&gt;Focuses on FP&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-end=&quot;6552&quot; data-start=&quot;6535&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Focuses on FN&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-end=&quot;6557&quot; data-start=&quot;6554&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-end=&quot;6601&quot; data-start=&quot;6559&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1amyqv7&quot;&gt;Q3. When should Recall be prioritized?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;6642&quot; data-start=&quot;6603&quot;&gt;When missing a positive case is costly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-end=&quot;6651&quot; data-start=&quot;6644&quot;&gt;Example&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;6689&quot; data-start=&quot;6653&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;6671&quot; data-start=&quot;6653&quot; data-section-id=&quot;sd3s4f&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cancer Detection&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-end=&quot;6689&quot; data-